WEBVTT

00:05:59.698 --> 00:06:03.104
So for Linda, and for so many women,

00:06:03.104 --> 00:06:06.796
the gold standard test wasn't gold.

00:06:06.796 --> 00:06:09.783
Now, Linda received the right treatment.

00:06:09.783 --> 00:06:11.961
She went back to her life and, fortunately, today

00:06:11.961 --> 00:06:13.713
she is doing well.

00:06:13.713 --> 00:06:15.319
But Linda was lucky.

00:06:15.319 --> 00:06:17.945
She found us, we found her disease.

00:06:17.945 --> 00:06:20.856
But for too many women, that's not the case.

00:06:20.856 --> 00:06:23.171
We have the tools.

00:06:23.171 --> 00:06:26.852
We have the technology to make the diagnosis.

00:06:26.852 --> 00:06:30.249
But it's all too often that these sex diffferences